  "description": {
   "en": "A young delivery driver named Michio Sagara has a hudden and twisted fetish.\nHe can only become aroused through voyeuristic filming.\nNight after night, he indulges in his secret obsession, satisfying his distorted desires.\nAs this lifestyle continues, simple voyeurism is no longer enough to satisfy him.\nSeeking greater thrills, he ventures into an abandoned video store rumored to be a hotspot for compensated dating.\nThere, just as the rumors suggested, a middle-aged man arrives with a mysterious beauty in a school uniform, Momoko Mikami.\nThe two enter the video store and immediately begin touching each other, and just as things are about to escalate, Momoko suddenly stabs the man to death.\nShe, too, harbors a twisted fetish. Her desires can only be fulfilled through murder.\nReaching her climax from the act, Momoko’s ecstasy is witnessed by Sagara, awakening a new fetish within him as he experiences his own peak.\nEventually, the two join forces to satisfy their warped cravings, taking it upon themselves to eliminate the depraved criminals lurking in the city…\n\n(Source: MangaUpdates)"
